    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, if the max is 4000mg, but you're saying i should only take 3 doses... isn't that only 3000mg if they are 1000mg pills? i'm in a lot of pain and 3000mg doesn't feel like much for someone my size. if i take 1000mg every 4 hours, i'd hit that 4000mg limit pretty quick. is it actually dangerous to go a little over that limit for just one night if it means i can actually sleep? i feel like i can handle it.",
